{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-08-31 16:15:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF LAWLOGIX', 'text': "ACQUISITION EXPANDS EQUIFAX WORKFORCE SOLUTIONS BUSINESS UNIT AND BOLSTERS COMPANY'S ROBUST PORTFOLIO OF EMPLOYER SOLUTIONS ATLANTA , AUG. 31, 2022\xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF LAWLOGIX, A LEADING PROVIDER OF CLOUD-BASED I-9 SOFTWARE AND IMMIGRATION CASE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE. THE DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE LAWLOGIX WAS ANNOUNCED ON JULY 21, 2022."}